Z||000000||Shaun41178||08-10-2001||01:29 AM||||This place used to be NRT as I am sure most of you know.<P>But just to remind this is the same guy (nick) who does the 3.4 buildups and all that other good stuff that can also apply to any 60 degree v6 engine.  I have met Nick and he is a cool guy.  He is the one that always did my dyno pulls.  He knows a lot about engine building and I would recommend him to you guys for your head porting or 60 degree buildups if you are in the NW ohio or SE michigan area.  Or just ship to him.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.nu-tekmotorsports.com" TARGET=_blank>www.nu-tekmotorsports.com</A> ||||reg||1
